  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final project evaluation of the Transform SRGR programme implemented by the SRHR Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is a final evaluation of the Transform SRHR project, commissioned to :  (1) Assess the strategic relevance and added value of the project to CSOs working on SRHR, within the period 2023-2026   ; (2) Assess  project&apos;s effectiveness in shifting the narratives and building public support for contested SRHR issues ; (3) To document best practices and lessons, to improve efficiency and collaboration within future consortium based projects ; (4)To document prospects for a sustained response by the Rapid Response Team beyond the project. 
The report will provide overall accountability for investment. Findings from the evaluation will be used to improve mitigation of backlash within ongoing SRHR projects and future activities, inform design and implementation of future consortium-based projects.</narrative>
  </description>
